{"screen_name": "infinityspoon", "first_seen": "2025-09-18T23:02:51.624935", "last_updated": "2025-10-06T11:55:49.355858", "profile": {"id": 1080989, "acceptable": false, "creator": true, "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1699412770985508864/qMVKyNEv.jpg", "name": "無限匙だちょう", "nsfw_acceptable": true, "screen_name": "infinityspoon", "language": "ja", "body_size": 10000, "received_works_count": 96, "received_nsfw_works_count": 92, "appeal_receivable": false, "sent_first_works_count": 0, "sent_public_works_count": 0, "instruction": "unspecified", "description": "twitterと言うアプリで絵を投稿していました。\nMisskey→http://misskey.io/@infinityspoon\n\nskeb→http://skeb.jp/@infinityspoon\n※開放時期は不定期となっています。", "busy": false, "url": null, "show_social_profile": true, "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "received_requests_average_response_time": 72386, "completing_average_time": 1865356, "nc": 176, "twitter_uid": "758059086856331264", "user_service_link": [], "banned": false, "banned_by": "", "complete_rate": 1, "og_image_url": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Ffcdn.skeb.jp%2Fassets%2Fv1%2Fcommons%2Fogp.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=1200&h=630&s=fb919ed2f719addcbe44cbdea9c1851a", "skills": [{"genre": "art", "default_amount": 7000}], "acceptable_only_public": false, "tip_acceptable": true, "yearly_report_client_visible": false, "total_appeals_count": 0, "received_works": [{"path": "/@infinityspoon/works/96", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1080989, "client_id": 8151, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f04259d/uploads/origins/fb6230fe-2ad9-43b9-a7fe-d7e76628ee38?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65c5ae912ba60afe0c687cef84e72580", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f04259d/uploads/origins/fb6230fe-2ad9-43b9-a7fe-d7e76628ee38?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f0fd694faa978d799fea001ed7f96181", "src_set": ""}, "body": "御世話になります。\n「艦これの鹿島が男にクロロホルムを嗅がされて眠らされるシーン」をお願いします。\n・基本表情に「驚き」差分に「もがき」「目がとろーん」「薬が効き目の焦点が合わない」「白目を向き、気絶寸前（こちらは余裕があれば、で大丈夫です）」「目を閉じ気絶」「ハンカチ無しで寝顔が見える」をお願いします。\n・犯人は腕など一部分やシルエットで大丈夫です。背景もこだわりません。\n・全裸で、おっぱいやスジ(陰毛)が見える構図でお願いいたします。\n・犯人に抱きしめられる感じで眠らされます。\n・よければ台詞や効果音の有無差分もよろしいでしょうか。", "nc": 56, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@infinityspoon/works/95", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1080989, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef0ccb6b/uploads/origins/b99ddcfa-0693-4476-91d4-d07aabb9dc58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f68e59acdcd77b0cbd184fcf4bb6a2f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef0ccb6b/uploads/origins/b99ddcfa-0693-4476-91d4-d07aabb9dc58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=779fc9bd2c4e350c7e917605a2404c65", "src_set": ""}, "body": "艦これの大井が寝取られ好きな提督の為に色んな男に股開いて、提督に報告する複数ページの漫画をお願いします。寝取られなのでシチュエーションはおまかせします。", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@infinityspoon/works/94", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a14b8ccd/uploads/origins/c28ddc63-8e9d-436a-8845-99a046d1585d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=67ab1dc25ba69d0a260cd81335c9c3d9", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1080989, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": fals